  "details": "Post Processing has a big performance penalty when it present in the world and even disabling all Post-Process Volume components does not restore performance fully.\n\nTo gain maximum performance boost it's nessesarry do disable Post-Process Layer component attached to player camera.\n\nPlease add Udon hook that will allow world creators to toggle Post-Process Layer component so people can completely disable Post Processing in the worlds with in-world toggle buttons to gain as maximum performance as possible.\n\nAdded performance test results captured with SteamVR Advanced Frame Timings window.\n\nWorld without Post-Process Layer. Button in world does nothing\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_89d9698e-a8ab-4112-bf38-dfdb04fd9e87/info\n\nWorld with Post-Process Layer and Post-Process Volume. Button toggles Post-Process Volume object.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_9c0d4344-0fc4-40f0-af3a-dadc81974fe7/info",
